{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224450","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322445001:1":{"text":"誰だ……お前ら？ど、どっか行け！","source_cn":"你们……是谁？走、走开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x034F5190D0E13A46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322445002:1":{"text":"イリーナさんに大事な話があって来ました！","source_cn":"我们找伊琳娜，有重要的事要和她说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x004E0330BB32EC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322445003:1":{"text":"どけ……邪魔だ。俺は今から飲みに行くんだよ！","source_cn":"别……挡路，我正要出门、出门喝一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D37E0C86E0F3746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322445004:1":{"text":"とても大事な話なんです！","source_cn":"我们有非常重要的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40CBAAD188187D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322445005:1":{"text":"ヒック、だから誰だって……聞いて……おいフラフラするな、じっとしてろ！","source_cn":"啧，你们是谁啊……怎么……一个劲在、在晃？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x251F877C04C35CCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322445006:1":{"text":"フラフラなのはあなたでしょ！ちょっと飲みすぎですよ！","source_cn":"我们哪有晃啊！是你喝太多了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44A62C9ECA3E9179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322445007:1":{"text":"飲みすぎだぁ？どこがだよ……まったく足りねぇよ！","source_cn":"喝太多？哪有……不够，根本不够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D872E689D23B630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1322445007":{"text":"飲みすぎだぁ？どこがだよ……まったく足りねぇよ！","source_cn":"喝太多？哪有……不够，根本不够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D872E689D23B630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322445008:1":{"text":"ゲップ……あのガキはなぁ、誰にも会いたがらないんだよ！分かったらどっか行け！","source_cn":"那孩子，嗝！谁也不会见的，省省吧你！走开，快走开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27F69E4EACCF5EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322445011:1":{"text":"帰れ、帰れ！せっかくの酒が不味くなっちまうぞ！","source_cn":"走开，走开！别耽误我喝酒……哈哈，喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B75AC93E6E8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1322445011":{"text":"帰れ、帰れ！せっかくの酒が不味くなっちまうぞ！","source_cn":"走开，走开！别耽误我喝酒……哈哈，喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B75AC93E6E8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322445012:1":{"text":"ちっ、本当にめんどくさいヤツらだ。はいはい、分かったよ。その前に飲みに……","source_cn":"嘁，真是麻烦！行了行了，我、我知道了。让让，我……要去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81CC38A6603F092B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322445016:1":{"text":"イリーナを……外出させないようにする、ヒック！それでいいんだろ？","source_cn":"让她不要……近期不要出门，嗝！这就行了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFAEDAB0B4BA32EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322445017:1":{"text":"さあ、ちゃんと聞いたぞ！いい加減に帰ってくれ！","source_cn":"你们，该干什么就……干什么去吧！别来烦老子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E84420C04553045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"じゃあ、外に出ないよう伝えてくれ。","source_cn":"请务必转达","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5631C929FDF7DD74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"じゃあ、外に出ないよう伝えてくれ。","female":"じゃあ、外に出ないよう伝えて。","variant_male_record_index":"70156","variant_female_record_index":"70157","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322445013:1":{"text":"な……なんだよ？","source_cn":"你……你们要怎样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA312D657FBAC63B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322445014:1":{"text":"イリーナさんの身の安全のためです。あなたが聞いてくれないなら、実力行使も仕方ありませんね。","source_cn":"事关伊琳娜的人身安全，如果你做不到，我们就只能动用物理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D617304A6C32145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322445015:1":{"text":"えっ……いや、実力行使……？よ、よし……分かった。","source_cn":"呃……算、算你厉害……行了，我……知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A6F4AC1D7905B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"怪我しても僕たちを責めるなよ……","source_cn":"你要是不听，就别怪我们……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x674FAD49ED9E0B06","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"怪我しても僕たちを責めるなよ……","female":"怪我しても私たちを責めないでね……","variant_male_record_index":"70158","variant_female_record_index":"70159","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"イリーナに会わせてくれ。","source_cn":"请带我们见伊琳娜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBC258A12B8A8BD30","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"イリーナに会わせてくれ。","female":"イリーナに会わせて。","variant_male_record_index":"70150","variant_female_record_index":"70151","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322445009:1":{"text":"洗脳だぁ……ヒック、あんなガキを洗脳しても、何の役にも立たないだろ。","source_cn":"蛊惑……什么蛊惑？瞎说，她……嗝，她有什么值、值得蛊惑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F50502DF96801D","variant_stat